## Description

S2.5-01a adds the exact-membership deletion boundary and management evidence needed by later removal checks. WorkOS reads now preserve missing evidence as unknown before the SDK can default it to ordinary.

## Review

**T2 Need architect — T2: declarations changed in 1 public module.** The impact declaration also flags internal-interface change (T2) and sensitive membership behavior (T1).

**Architecture facts** (candidate `122d65bf`, merge base `9d0546b9`):

- src/accounts/organizations/organization-directory.ts (+6 -0 lines)

<details><summary>Declaration diff</summary>

```diff
